<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">I recently called you but wanted to also reach out by email. My name is {!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}, and I am your personal admission counselor at Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for taking the time to visit ASU. I hope you enjoyed your campus tour. I would love to hear back from you to find out what you enjoyed most about your visit.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Your next step is to <a href="http://students.asu.edu/apply">apply to ASU</a>. If you aren’t quite sure which major is right for you, use our <a href="http://asu.edu/degrees">degree search</a> tool to find majors that interest you based on keyword, campus or college. You can also compare degrees side-by-side to review admission criteria, get a sense of what each major is about, and find out about jobs and salaries earned with each degree.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to ask.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>